1
00:00:14,484 --> 00:00:18,029
<font color="white">雖然上一次沒辦法和你認真交手</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:18,113 --> 00:00:20,574
<font color="white">這次也許能好好跟你玩一場</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:51,688 --> 00:00:53,065
<font color="white">看招</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:58,862 --> 00:01:03,116
<font color="white">你難道是會輕易被解決掉的類型？</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:01:04,868 --> 00:01:07,662
<font color="white">這樣啊，真是太好了</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:01:07,746 --> 00:01:10,707
<font color="white">看來是我擔心過頭了</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:01:13,585 --> 00:01:15,420
<font color="white">給我住手</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:01:16,546 --> 00:01:18,131
<font color="white">諸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:19,508 --> 00:01:20,884
<font color="white">進次郎人在哪裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:01:20,967 --> 00:01:22,886
<font color="white">讓他逃走了</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:01:46,868 --> 00:01:49,913
<font color="white">-妳這傢伙…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-之後再來處理她</font></font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:01:51,164 --> 00:01:55,502
<font color="white">你那句話的意思是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">要把最喜歡的留到最後嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:57,003 --> 00:01:58,964
<font color="white">算了，就這樣吧</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:59,047 --> 00:02:01,133
<font color="white">我們下次再見</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,494
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:03:58,208 --> 00:03:59,417
<font color="white">喂</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:04:02,254 --> 00:04:04,714
<font color="white">來，進來吧</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:04:07,550 --> 00:04:09,135
<font color="white">竟然有這種地方？</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:04:09,219 --> 00:04:11,179
<font color="white">這裡就像是我的祕密基地</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:04:11,263 --> 00:04:12,973
<font color="white">是安全屋吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:04:13,056 --> 00:04:14,849
<font color="white">不用分那麼細啦</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:04:14,933 --> 00:04:16,768
<font color="white">你就放鬆一下吧</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:04:19,229 --> 00:04:20,313
<font color="white">你一定餓了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:04:20,397 --> 00:04:22,774
<font color="white">來，這個紅豆麵包給你吃</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:04:22,857 --> 00:04:24,651
<font color="white">謝謝你</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:04:24,734 --> 00:04:27,737
<font color="white">畢竟餓著肚子就沒辦法打仗啊</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,035
<font color="white">不用擔心啦</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:04:34,119 --> 00:04:36,288
<font color="white">那只是普通的自來水</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:04:36,788 --> 00:04:38,123
<font color="white">謝謝</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:43,712 --> 00:04:46,172
<font color="white">你真的長大了呢</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:46,256 --> 00:04:48,174
<font color="white">我小時候和你見過面嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:48,258 --> 00:04:50,010
<font color="white">到底有沒有呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:04:50,093 --> 00:04:51,136
<font color="white">是有還是沒有？</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:51,219 --> 00:04:52,262
<font color="white">到了我這個年紀</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:52,345 --> 00:04:54,806
<font color="white">會變得很多小事都不記得了</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:55,890 --> 00:04:58,810
<font color="white">那你為什麼要幫我？</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:59,352 --> 00:05:01,229
<font color="white">因為我一直守望著你</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:05:01,896 --> 00:05:06,943
<font color="white">看著早田進的兒子</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">作為超人力霸王逐漸成長的模樣</font></font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:05:07,652 --> 00:05:10,739
<font color="white">所以你也知道我爸是…</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:05:11,698 --> 00:05:14,034
<font color="white">你是指他是超人力霸王的事情？</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:14,659 --> 00:05:16,745
<font color="white">我早就注意到了</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:05:16,828 --> 00:05:18,788
<font color="white">從我還在科學特搜隊的時候開始</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:18,872 --> 00:05:21,082
<font color="white">那是真的嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:05:21,166 --> 00:05:25,003
<font color="white">但你是如何得知關於我們的事情？</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:26,087 --> 00:05:27,547
<font color="white">跟那個時候比起來</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:27,630 --> 00:05:30,133
<font color="white">最近變得越來越便利</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:05:30,216 --> 00:05:32,010
<font color="white">過來這裡</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:05:35,221 --> 00:05:37,891
<font color="white">就算不在科學特搜隊</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:05:38,391 --> 00:05:43,730
<font color="white">我還是能得到這種程度的資訊</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:05:47,275 --> 00:05:48,318
<font color="white">看吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:05:50,195 --> 00:05:51,654
<font color="white">不會吧</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:51,738 --> 00:05:54,741
<font color="white">難道你駭進了科學特搜隊的數據庫？</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:54,824 --> 00:05:58,119
<font color="white">別這樣，話不要說得這麼難聽啦</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:58,203 --> 00:06:03,458
<font color="white">我只是剛好猜到密碼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">然後進去稍微偷看一下</font></font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:06:04,459 --> 00:06:07,337
<font color="white">那就是駭客的行為啦</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:06:07,921 --> 00:06:09,464
<font color="white">這可是犯罪行為啊</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:06:09,547 --> 00:06:12,801
<font color="white">真是的，最近的超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">不只是體型小</font></font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:06:12,884 --> 00:06:14,928
<font color="white">說起話來也很吹毛求疵</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:06:15,011 --> 00:06:17,055
<font color="white">你那麼死腦筋</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:06:17,138 --> 00:06:19,557
<font color="white">可是會變成梅菲斯特的獵物喔</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:06:19,641 --> 00:06:20,725
<font color="white">梅菲斯特？</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:06:20,809 --> 00:06:27,023
<font color="white">沒錯，就是前陣子大放厥詞</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">說要打敗超人力霸王的那個外星人</font></font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:06:27,690 --> 00:06:29,359
<font color="white">這傢伙是…</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:06:29,442 --> 00:06:32,821
<font color="white">你說他宣告要打敗</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王又是怎麼回事？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:06:32,904 --> 00:06:35,323
<font color="white">什麼？你沒聽說嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:36,157 --> 00:06:40,912
<font color="white">這傢伙不就是打敗你爸的外星人嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:06:42,122 --> 00:06:47,085
<font color="white">你究竟是何方神聖？</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:48,044 --> 00:06:51,089
<font color="white">其實你明明就知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王不是壞人，對不對？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:51,172 --> 00:06:54,759
<font color="white">然而他們只因為好玩</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:54,843 --> 00:06:57,262
<font color="white">就隨口亂說些有的沒的</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:57,804 --> 00:06:59,806
<font color="white">太過分了</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:07:02,475 --> 00:07:05,270
<font color="white">已經過三小時了呢</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:07:05,353 --> 00:07:07,147
<font color="white">超人力霸王！</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:07:08,148 --> 00:07:10,150
<font color="white">你是科學特搜隊的成員？</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:07:10,233 --> 00:07:14,571
<font color="white">我是覺得這樣的登場方式</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">比較能讓你認出我啦</font></font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:07:16,114 --> 00:07:19,409
<font color="white">不過很可惜，我不是科學特搜隊的人</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:07:19,492 --> 00:07:21,995
<font color="white">我記得你</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:07:22,078 --> 00:07:24,956
<font color="white">雖然裝扮成超人力霸王的樣子</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">但你其實只是為了錢</font></font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:07:25,039 --> 00:07:27,292
<font color="white">把我形容得還真難聽啊</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:27,375 --> 00:07:29,752
<font color="white">我跟那種傢伙沒什麼好說的</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:29,836 --> 00:07:32,297
<font color="white">你等的人不會來喔</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:34,048
<font color="white">你這是什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:34,132 --> 00:07:37,677
<font color="white">貝姆拉或許已經被那些傢伙消滅了</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:38,303 --> 00:07:39,637
<font color="white">你說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:39,721 --> 00:07:42,599
<font color="white">我只是個傳話者</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:42,682 --> 00:07:45,226
<font color="white">他是這麼說的</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:45,310 --> 00:07:48,771
<font color="white">“真相就在光之力量中”</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:48,855 --> 00:07:51,483
<font color="white">什麼？他到底在說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:52,066 --> 00:07:53,651
<font color="white">誰知道</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:53,735 --> 00:07:57,572
<font color="white">只是覺得這對你可能會有幫助</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:57,655 --> 00:08:00,450
<font color="white">那我就告辭了</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:08:01,201 --> 00:08:02,994
<font color="white">再見囉</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:08:09,584 --> 00:08:11,211
<font color="white">在12年前</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:08:11,294 --> 00:08:16,716
<font color="white">曾是科學特搜隊的隊員們各奔東西</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:08:18,134 --> 00:08:22,889
<font color="white">井手那時候也邀我回歸科學特搜隊</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:08:24,432 --> 00:08:26,100
<font color="white">你覺得如何？</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:08:26,184 --> 00:08:29,020
<font color="white">看來早田有意願回來</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:08:29,103 --> 00:08:32,190
<font color="white">我希望你也能一併回歸</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:08:32,774 --> 00:08:34,776
<font color="white">井手，很抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:08:35,443 --> 00:08:38,655
<font color="white">我就當作沒聽過你說的那些話</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:08:39,239 --> 00:08:41,282
<font color="white">到底是為什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:08:41,366 --> 00:08:46,704
<font color="white">這地方看起來就像</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">我們待過的那個科學特搜隊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:08:47,872 --> 00:08:49,249
<font color="white">但是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:08:49,332 --> 00:08:51,042
<font color="white">內在卻完全不同</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:51,125 --> 00:08:53,670
<font color="white">你這是什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:53,753 --> 00:08:57,840
<font color="white">運用外星人那些超乎想像的技術</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:08:57,924 --> 00:09:01,886
<font color="white">那當然也有辦法自行創造超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:03,721
<font color="white">不過呢</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:09:03,805 --> 00:09:06,057
<font color="white">一旦染指那種可怕的東西</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:08,935
<font color="white">你們難道不怕會控制不住自己嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:09,018 --> 00:09:12,272
<font color="white">所以才會需要像早田和你這種</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:09:12,355 --> 00:09:14,941
<font color="white">深知那股力量</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">有多可怕的人來協助我們啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:09:16,276 --> 00:09:20,321
<font color="white">我只是上個時代的倖存者</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:09:20,905 --> 00:09:24,576
<font color="white">以前總是不顧後果，全力以赴</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:09:24,659 --> 00:09:27,120
<font color="white">但現在已經不是那種時代了</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:09:28,204 --> 00:09:29,747
<font color="white">與其如此</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:09:30,957 --> 00:09:36,379
<font color="white">我寧願監看著你們</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">確保你們不要因此誤入歧途</font></font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:09:37,964 --> 00:09:40,717
<font color="white">如果你們幹出了什麼蠢事</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,552
<font color="white">我可不會放過你們</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:09:44,512 --> 00:09:45,930
<font color="white">事情就是這樣</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:09:46,014 --> 00:09:48,641
<font color="white">我表面上裝成一般的市民</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:09:48,725 --> 00:09:51,978
<font color="white">卻像這樣在暗地裡行動</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:09:52,854 --> 00:09:55,940
<font color="white">也多虧如此，我才能救到你</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:09:56,524 --> 00:10:00,403
<font color="white">我都想稱讚一下選擇踏上</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">跟夥伴們不同道路的自己呢</font></font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:10:03,448 --> 00:10:05,074
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:10:05,867 --> 00:10:08,202
<font color="white">先不論你的做法如何</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:10:08,286 --> 00:10:10,204
<font color="white">真的很謝謝你</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:10:11,331 --> 00:10:12,915
<font color="white">那我走了</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:10:12,999 --> 00:10:14,667
<font color="white">喂，等等啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:10:14,751 --> 00:10:16,794
<font color="white">你是打算去哪裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:10:16,878 --> 00:10:19,130
<font color="white">我不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:10:19,213 --> 00:10:21,382
<font color="white">但是我一定得走</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:10:21,466 --> 00:10:24,010
<font color="white">你現在就算出去</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:10:24,093 --> 00:10:28,348
<font color="white">也只會闖入科學特搜隊的包圍網</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:10:28,431 --> 00:10:31,100
<font color="white">不然就是陷入梅菲斯特的計謀</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:10:31,184 --> 00:10:32,560
<font color="white">那麼…</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:10:33,102 --> 00:10:34,771
<font color="white">我到底該怎麼做？</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:34,854 --> 00:10:36,356
<font color="white">這個嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:36,439 --> 00:10:40,735
<font color="white">你暫時也只能在這裡等囉</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:10:40,818 --> 00:10:42,654
<font color="white">等什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:10:44,822 --> 00:10:47,909
<font color="white">等機會到來啊</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:10:48,785 --> 00:10:52,413
<font color="white">雖然那小子出現在</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">井手先生說的那個地方…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:10:52,497 --> 00:10:53,331
<font color="white">有人從旁干預啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:10:53,414 --> 00:10:57,335
<font color="white">那個從旁干預的人到底是誰？</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:10:57,418 --> 00:11:00,129
<font color="white">嵐大助</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:11:00,213 --> 00:11:02,048
<font color="white">是那個前科學特搜隊隊員？</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:11:02,131 --> 00:11:04,092
<font color="white">像他那種人為什麼會做出這種事？</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:11:04,592 --> 00:11:05,843
<font color="white">聽好了</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:11:05,927 --> 00:11:08,096
<font color="white">梅菲斯特那傢伙是這麼說的</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:11:08,179 --> 00:11:10,181
<font color="white">也就是說</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:10,765 --> 00:11:14,352
<font color="white">我們要排除四名超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:15,937 --> 00:11:18,856
<font color="white">早田已被對方打敗</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:21,192
<font color="white">現在剩下三位</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:21,275 --> 00:11:24,695
<font color="white">其中一個自然就是你</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:11:24,779 --> 00:11:28,699
<font color="white">另外兩位指的是誰呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:11:28,783 --> 00:11:30,410
<font color="white">天曉得</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:11:31,702 --> 00:11:33,871
<font color="white">很好，打開了</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:11:33,955 --> 00:11:38,209
<font color="white">現存的超人力霸王共有六位</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:38,292 --> 00:11:41,421
<font color="white">再加上貝姆拉的話就是七位</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:11:42,338 --> 00:11:43,881
<font color="white">在此之中</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:11:43,965 --> 00:11:48,845
<font color="white">身為超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你跟早田的共通點是什麼？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:11:48,928 --> 00:11:49,971
<font color="white">（超人力霸王、佐菲）</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:11:50,972 --> 00:11:52,473
<font color="white">斯派修姆光線！</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:11:52,557 --> 00:11:53,599
<font color="white">原來如此</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:11:53,683 --> 00:11:59,522
<font color="white">假設我們稱它為“光之巨人的力量”</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:11:59,605 --> 00:12:02,650
<font color="white">那麼貝姆拉也是…</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:12:02,733 --> 00:12:04,610
<font color="white">我想是的</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:12:04,694 --> 00:12:11,576
<font color="white">如果梅菲斯特那混蛋的目的是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">消滅光之巨人的那股力量…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:12:11,659 --> 00:12:16,164
<font color="white">他的第四個目標</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也擁有斯派修姆的力量</font></font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:12:16,247 --> 00:12:21,502
<font color="white">但梅菲斯特宣稱</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">已打倒兩個超人力霸王</font></font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:12:22,587 --> 00:12:25,339
<font color="white">我心中只有不好的預感</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:12:27,175 --> 00:12:30,052
<font color="white">（警察署）</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:12:30,136 --> 00:12:33,639
{\an8}<font color="white">（急速上升熱門影片第一名</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王破壞淡谷總集篇）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:12:33,723 --> 00:12:37,018
{\an8}<font color="white">你為什麼要看那種</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王的影片？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:12:37,101 --> 00:12:39,479
<font color="white">有些事讓我很在意</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:12:40,354 --> 00:12:43,900
<font color="white">“真相就在光之力量中”</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:12:45,485 --> 00:12:47,403
<font color="white">那到底是什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:12:47,987 --> 00:12:50,323
<font color="white">不管怎樣，真是太好了</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:12:50,406 --> 00:12:53,117
<font color="white">感覺遠藤先生找回幹勁了</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:12:53,201 --> 00:12:55,745
<font color="white">你就別管我了</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:13:00,541 --> 00:13:02,877
<font color="white">這檯燈感覺快沒電了</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,045
<font color="white">我拿新的來換</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:13:04,128 --> 00:13:06,589
<font color="white">-謝謝</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不客氣</font></font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:13:07,173 --> 00:13:11,219
<font color="white">資料裡留有嵐前隊員以前的住址</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:13:11,302 --> 00:13:13,179
<font color="white">我們要不要先調查這個住址？</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:13:13,262 --> 00:13:14,430
<font color="white">沒用的</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:13:14,514 --> 00:13:18,434
<font color="white">他可是能獨自對付這科學特搜隊的人</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:13:18,518 --> 00:13:21,771
<font color="white">最後只會發現是假情報吧</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:13:21,854 --> 00:13:24,023
<font color="white">你說得對</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:13:27,401 --> 00:13:29,237
<font color="white">你要去哪裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,905
<font color="white">我有私事要辦</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:13:30,988 --> 00:13:32,281
<font color="white">請等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:13:32,365 --> 00:13:34,325
<font color="white">我能問你一件事嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:13:34,408 --> 00:13:35,576
<font color="white">什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:39,288
<font color="white">你那個時候為什麼要放走進次郎？</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:13:39,372 --> 00:13:40,915
<font color="white">放走他？</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:13:40,998 --> 00:13:44,335
<font color="white">我只是被那位前隊員的突襲擺了一道</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:13:44,418 --> 00:13:46,003
<font color="white">是真的嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:13:46,879 --> 00:13:48,756
<font color="white">那我反問你</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:13:48,839 --> 00:13:54,971
<font color="white">你真的認為這次的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">一連串事件都是那小子做的？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:13:55,054 --> 00:13:56,847
<font color="white">你這是什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:13:56,931 --> 00:13:59,517
<font color="white">那傢伙雖然冒失</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:04,021
<font color="white">但我不認為他會如此草率</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">引發像這次的事件</font></font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:14:04,105 --> 00:14:07,567
<font color="white">我大概懂你的意思，但是…</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:14:11,112 --> 00:14:14,198
<font color="white">我沒辦法否定自己看到的那幕</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:14:14,282 --> 00:14:16,325
<font color="white">那就該更深入去檢驗</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:14:16,409 --> 00:14:20,621
<font color="white">所有的證據都指出是那傢伙幹的</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:14:20,705 --> 00:14:22,665
<font color="white">找不到半點破綻</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:14:24,333 --> 00:14:28,963
<font color="white">就是那點讓我覺得不對勁</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:14:33,634 --> 00:14:35,136
<font color="white">真厲害</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:14:35,219 --> 00:14:37,138
<font color="white">諸星彈</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:14:37,221 --> 00:14:41,684
<font color="white">他的戰鬥力和思考能力都相當優異</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:14:41,767 --> 00:14:44,812
<font color="white">但他並沒有光之巨人的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:14:45,354 --> 00:14:48,232
<font color="white">而且他的性格很極端</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:14:48,316 --> 00:14:49,525
<font color="white">（北斗星司</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">王牌）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:14:49,609 --> 00:14:51,402
<font color="white">北斗星司</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:14:51,485 --> 00:14:53,613
<font color="white">他身穿以外星人亞普魯的技術</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:14:53,696 --> 00:14:57,783
<font color="white">開發出來的王牌裝甲展開活動</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:14:58,868 --> 00:15:03,080
<font color="white">我們應該將這傢伙歸類於</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">因裝甲而獲取力量的其中一人</font></font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:15:03,873 --> 00:15:07,084
<font color="white">我覺得那傢伙現在就已經夠危險了</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:15:07,793 --> 00:15:10,171
<font color="white">傑克，真實姓名不詳</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:15:11,047 --> 00:15:15,551
<font color="white">外星人街的情報販子</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也是前格鬥冠軍</font></font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:15:16,260 --> 00:15:19,597
<font color="white">他能以人類的身體</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">與外星人打得不相上下</font></font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:15:20,681 --> 00:15:23,184
<font color="white">雖然他純粹只是一個地球人</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:15:23,267 --> 00:15:25,603
<font color="white">但他身上有很多謎團也是事實</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:15:26,187 --> 00:15:28,940
<font color="white">東光太郎</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:15:29,023 --> 00:15:30,650
<font color="white">是一位記者</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:15:30,733 --> 00:15:32,109
<font color="white">他在被捲入過去發生的</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:15:32,193 --> 00:15:35,571
<font color="white">大量一般市民消失事件時</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:15:35,655 --> 00:15:40,493
<font color="white">情報指出他因某種原因</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">而獲得特殊能力</font></font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:15:40,993 --> 00:15:43,371
<font color="white">但我不確定其中究竟有幾分真實</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:15:43,454 --> 00:15:46,958
<font color="white">我不是很了解太郎先生的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:15:47,041 --> 00:15:50,670
<font color="white">不過能感受到他擁有的熱情</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:15:52,463 --> 00:15:54,590
<font color="white">然後就是貝姆拉</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:15:54,674 --> 00:15:56,258
<font color="white">沒有人知道他的真面目</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:15:56,342 --> 00:15:57,218
<font color="white">（貝姆拉</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">無資料）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:15:57,301 --> 00:15:59,845
<font color="white">他最初雖然與你們敵對</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:15:59,929 --> 00:16:01,973
<font color="white">不過在黃金城塞之戰的時候</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:16:02,056 --> 00:16:04,767
<font color="white">他保護了淡谷的城鎮</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:16:04,850 --> 00:16:06,477
<font color="white">雖然身上還有許多未解之謎</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:08,396
<font color="white">但他也能使出斯派修姆光線</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:16:08,479 --> 00:16:12,358
<font color="white">顯然擁有光之巨人的力量</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">這是無庸置疑的</font></font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:16:12,441 --> 00:16:13,693
<font color="white">也就是說</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:16:13,776 --> 00:16:17,196
<font color="white">梅菲斯特說的四位超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:16:17,279 --> 00:16:21,117
<font color="white">只剩下一位還無法釐清身分</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:16:21,951 --> 00:16:25,079
<font color="white">從這些情報看來</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:16:25,162 --> 00:16:28,708
<font color="white">和你們幾個可能具有共同點的人</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:16:28,791 --> 00:16:30,793
<font color="white">就是太郎了啊</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:16:30,876 --> 00:16:33,462
<font color="white">即使有點牽強</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:16:34,672 --> 00:16:35,881
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:16:36,465 --> 00:16:37,717
<font color="white">沒什麼</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:16:38,884 --> 00:16:43,389
<font color="white">我只是在想</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">為什麼你會這麼親切地幫我</font></font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:16:43,472 --> 00:16:45,725
<font color="white">因為你是早田的兒子啊</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:16:45,808 --> 00:16:48,477
<font color="white">怎麼可能不對你伸出援手</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:16:48,561 --> 00:16:50,855
<font color="white">這是原因之一</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:16:50,938 --> 00:16:53,691
<font color="white">我覺得井手也希望我那麼做</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:16:53,774 --> 00:16:59,155
<font color="white">井手先生？但他是下令要抓我的人</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:16:59,238 --> 00:17:00,531
<font color="white">表面上是這樣</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:17:01,115 --> 00:17:04,160
<font color="white">然而那傢伙一定很擔心你</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:17:04,243 --> 00:17:07,580
<font color="white">而且現在早田不在了，他一定更憂心</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:17:08,164 --> 00:17:10,916
<font color="white">你怎麼知道會是那樣？</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:17:11,500 --> 00:17:15,129
<font color="white">他一直以來像這樣</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">放任我在外就是證明</font></font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:17:15,212 --> 00:17:21,010
<font color="white">就是為了現在這種時候</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">那傢伙才會讓我自由行動</font></font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:17:21,886 --> 00:17:25,222
<font color="white">嵐先生，我果然還是得先走</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:17:25,306 --> 00:17:26,390
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:17:26,474 --> 00:17:28,017
<font color="white">你要我說幾遍才會懂？</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:17:28,100 --> 00:17:32,313
<font color="white">科學特搜隊和梅菲斯特一伙人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">可都是拚了命要找你</font></font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:17:33,022 --> 00:17:34,106
<font color="white">你現在要是出去</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:17:34,190 --> 00:17:36,192
<font color="white">可是正中他們的下懷啊</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:17:36,275 --> 00:17:37,610
<font color="white">我知道</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:17:37,693 --> 00:17:39,236
<font color="white">但我還是得走</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:42,156
<font color="white">我必須去證明自己的清白</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:17:42,239 --> 00:17:47,703
<font color="white">我覺得那才是讓井手先生、嵐先生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">和我爸安心的最佳方法</font></font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:17:48,788 --> 00:17:51,207
<font color="white">你這種一說出口就絕不讓步的地方</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:17:51,290 --> 00:17:52,583
<font color="white">也跟你老爸一模一樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:17:55,252 --> 00:17:59,381
<font color="white">那傢伙雖然說自己沒有當時的記憶</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:17:59,465 --> 00:18:01,759
<font color="white">不過他其實並沒有忘記所有的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:18:02,676 --> 00:18:04,136
<font color="white">我覺得早田他自己也是</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:18:04,220 --> 00:18:07,598
<font color="white">邊懷有煩惱邊持續擔任超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:18:08,724 --> 00:18:11,060
<font color="white">就像你現在這樣</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:18:11,644 --> 00:18:13,437
<font color="white">爸也曾經這樣？</font><font color="white"></font>

282
00:18:13,521 --> 00:18:16,315
<font color="white">雖然現在有很多人對你指手畫腳</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:18:16,398 --> 00:18:18,901
<font color="white">以前其實也發生過很多事</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:18:19,401 --> 00:18:22,822
<font color="white">像是破壞了城鎮之類的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:18:23,614 --> 00:18:27,785
<font color="white">每當遭逢那種狀況</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">早田都會去探望受害者</font></font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:18:27,868 --> 00:18:31,122
<font color="white">儘管我們都叫他不要去</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">因為只會讓事情變得複雜</font></font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:18:31,872 --> 00:18:33,916
<font color="white">可是那傢伙並沒有因此罷手</font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:18:35,918 --> 00:18:40,756
<font color="white">你也要一直保持這樣的你喔</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:18:43,551 --> 00:18:46,428
<font color="white">（要一直保持這樣的你喔）</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:18:46,512 --> 00:18:48,264
<font color="white">你剛才說的那句話…</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:18:48,347 --> 00:18:50,766
<font color="white">什麼？喔</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:18:50,850 --> 00:18:53,435
<font color="white">-以前早田曾這麼跟我說過</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-什麼？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:18:54,103 --> 00:18:55,855
<font color="white">那我走了</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:18:55,938 --> 00:18:57,815
<font color="white">等一下，嵐</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:18:59,108 --> 00:19:01,402
<font color="white">我明白你的感受了</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:19:01,485 --> 00:19:03,863
<font color="white">這的確像是你會做出的選擇</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:19:03,946 --> 00:19:05,614
<font color="white">是嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:19:05,698 --> 00:19:10,995
<font color="white">嵐，要一直保持這樣的你喔</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:19:12,329 --> 00:19:14,123
<font color="white">嵐先生</font><font color="white"></font>

300
00:19:14,707 --> 00:19:18,377
<font color="white">我好像知道自己該怎麼做了</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:20,212
<font color="white">你要怎麼做？</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:19:21,172 --> 00:19:25,885
<font color="white">要去查明爸究竟想對我傳達什麼</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:19:25,968 --> 00:19:29,930
<font color="white">那正是我現在應該要做的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:19:31,098 --> 00:19:32,725
<font color="white">這樣啊</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:19:32,808 --> 00:19:34,810
<font color="white">也許你那麼想是對的</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:19:34,894 --> 00:19:36,729
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:19:36,812 --> 00:19:39,523
<font color="white">總之啊，你如果遇到什麼麻煩</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:19:39,607 --> 00:19:41,984
<font color="white">都可以隨時來倚靠我</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:19:42,067 --> 00:19:44,153
<font color="white">謝謝你</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:19:47,656 --> 00:19:49,033
<font color="white">這是什麼聲音？</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:19:49,116 --> 00:19:50,951
<font color="white">看來有人來訪啊</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:19:59,126 --> 00:20:02,171
<font color="white">我說啊，燈光太刺眼了吧</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:20:02,254 --> 00:20:05,466
<font color="white">喔，剛才的燈泡太舊了</font><font color="white"></font>

314
00:20:05,549 --> 00:20:07,051
<font color="white">我換了一個新的</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:20:07,134 --> 00:20:09,261
<font color="white">這樣啊，謝啦</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:20:09,345 --> 00:20:11,805
<font color="white">換成了LED燈所以很亮</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:20:14,516 --> 00:20:15,893
<font color="white">“真相就在</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:20:15,976 --> 00:20:17,895
<font color="white">光之力量中”</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:20:19,063 --> 00:20:21,857
<font color="white">斯派修姆光線的顏色</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:20:24,109 --> 00:20:25,903
<font color="white">原來是這樣！</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:20:26,528 --> 00:20:28,906
<font color="white">怎麼了？遠藤先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:20:28,989 --> 00:20:30,783
<font color="white">你等一下啦</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:20:47,299 --> 00:20:48,509
<font color="white">（偵測到動作）</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:20:49,718 --> 00:20:50,761
<font color="white">（連線中斷）</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:20:51,470 --> 00:20:54,765
<font color="white">第二台勘測無人機也失去訊號了</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:21:02,481 --> 00:21:03,774
<font color="white">好厲害</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:21:04,275 --> 00:21:07,903
<font color="white">我待過的科學特搜隊</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">才不會這麼輕易被解決</font></font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:21:07,987 --> 00:21:10,114
<font color="white">我們有一種無重力彈</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:21:10,197 --> 00:21:12,866
<font color="white">是打敗那個積頓的超強力武器</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:21:14,118 --> 00:21:15,828
<font color="white">積頓？</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:21:20,874 --> 00:21:22,710
<font color="white">原來如此</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:21:22,793 --> 00:21:24,169
<font color="white">該不會是這樣吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:21:24,253 --> 00:21:25,546
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:21:26,088 --> 00:21:31,302
<font color="white">積頓是我爸還是超人力霸王時</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">最後對打的敵人吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:21:31,385 --> 00:21:34,179
<font color="white">對啊，這件事很有名吧</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:21:34,263 --> 00:21:36,056
<font color="white">嵐先生</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:21:36,140 --> 00:21:38,851
<font color="white">我也許能掌握到一些線索</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:21:48,152 --> 00:21:49,445
<font color="white">玲奈</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:21:49,987 --> 00:21:53,198
<font color="white">玲奈，我可能發現</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:21:53,282 --> 00:21:54,533
<font color="white">那起復興典禮事件的真相了</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:21:54,616 --> 00:21:56,869
<font color="white">超人力霸王的光正是關鍵</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:22:04,084 --> 00:22:06,045
<font color="white">都是多虧了你</font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:22:06,128 --> 00:22:09,798
<font color="white">我找到線索能解開那起事件的謎團了</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:22:09,882 --> 00:22:13,218
<font color="white">這樣啊，那真是太好了</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:24:07,249 --> 00:24:09,168
<font color="white">字幕翻譯：黃可涵</font><font color="white"></font>

